Z||000005||ThatRickGuy||05-21-2001||01:53 PM||||I saw a bloddy mess come out of an old lebaron once. the car had been stored over a wisconsin winter and a family of mice had made their home in the intake. well, on the initial start up that spring, the whole family got sucked into the turbo, and chewed up pretty bad. turbo never worked right after that either.||||reg||1
