Z||000008||Ken Wittlief||05-21-2001||03:10 PM||||Air filter: a paper and wire mesh baffel designed to allow air to pass, while blocking dirt, dust, pollen, insects, hummingbirds, flying fish and small rodents from entering the turbo or air intake manifold.<P> maybe if they put that in the users manual people would leave them in. ("what do I need this for, i dont drive on dirt roads - i dont live in the desert!")<P>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief for time allotment, content, and to fit the form of your TV screen).]<P><p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 05-21-2001).]||||reg||1
